*======================================================================
* fx.a99 - a module for tests/test_kernel.py (group fixed): only the
* fixed-point include, so that the test can call its routines.
*======================================================================
       COPY "kernel.equ"
       COPY "macros.a99"

       AORG >C000
       DATA INIT,TICK,INIT,0
INIT   RT
TICK   RT

       COPY "fixed.a99"
